  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Academy for Women Entrepreneurs (AWE) | Contanna Tea Production Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contanna vision is to bring happiness to every client that step in our community we believed that a good started can change all day mood..Contanna has the ambition of creating decent jobs for women in rural areas by buying their unsold items and transforming them into a luxury products , participate in the eradication of single use plastics by only using wood , metal or glasses and involve its customers community in the importance of protecting the environment by practicing reduction when they reuse there packaging..Within 5 years we plan to open our tea bar and be presented in at least 5 airport and mall in Ecowas we want to break barriers by creating a large chain of tea bar at the height of Starbucks and even more</narrative>
  </description>
